{"id":"u56","kelas":"kerja","no":9,"judul":"Presentasi","title":"Presentations","emoji":"🎤","ringkas":"Membuka, transisi, menjelaskan slide, dan tanya jawab","ready":true,"goals":["menyusun presentasi dengan struktur **pembuka, isi, dan penutup**","membuka presentasi: menyapa, memperkenalkan diri, topik, dan garis besar","memakai **signposting** (penanda transisi): [[Let's move on to ...]], [[Turning to ...]], [[As you can see ...]]","menjelaskan slide, grafik, dan poin penting dengan jelas","menutup presentasi dan menangani sesi **tanya jawab**","berbicara dengan jelas, mengatur tempo, dan mengurangi rasa gugup"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Presentasi di kantor bukan soal membaca slide, melainkan **menyampaikan pesan** supaya pendengar paham dan bertindak. Presentasi yang baik punya struktur sederhana: **Katakan apa yang akan kamu katakan, katakan, lalu ulangi apa yang sudah kamu katakan.**"},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur presentasi","table":[["Bagian","Isi","Contoh"],["**Opening**","salam, perkenalan, topik, tujuan","[[Good morning, everyone. My name is Dina, and today I'll talk about ...]]"],["**Outline**","garis besar","[[I'll cover three points: first, ... second, ... and finally, ...]]"],["**Body**","isi per poin","[[Let's start with the first point.]]"],["**Summary**","rangkuman","[[To sum up, ...]]"],["**Closing**","penutup dan terima kasih","[[Thank you for your attention.]]"],["**Q&A**","tanya jawab","[[I'd be happy to take any questions.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Membuka presentasi","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menyapa","[[Good morning, everyone. Thank you for being here.]]"],["Memperkenalkan diri","[[Let me introduce myself. I'm Dina, from the Sales team.]]"],["Menyebut topik","[[Today I'd like to talk about ...]] / [[The topic of my presentation is ...]]"],["Menyebut tujuan","[[The aim of this presentation is to ...]]"],["Menyebut garis besar","[[I've divided my talk into three parts.]]"],["Menjelaskan waktu","[[It will take about 15 minutes.]]"],["Mengatur tanya jawab","[[Please feel free to interrupt.]] / [[There will be time for questions at the end.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Signposting: transisi antarbagian","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Memulai poin pertama","[[Let's begin with ...]] / [[First of all, ...]]"],["Pindah poin","[[Let's move on to ...]] / [[Turning to ...]] / [[Now let me turn to ...]]"],["Menambah","[[In addition, ...]] / [[What's more, ...]]"],["Memberi contoh","[[For example, ...]] / [[Let me give you an example.]]"],["Menekankan","[[The key point is ...]] / [[What I want to stress is ...]]"],["Merujuk ke slide","[[As you can see on this slide, ...]] / [[This chart shows ...]]"],["Mengakhiri bagian","[[That brings me to the end of this section.]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"4. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"audience","id":"hadirin / pendengar","ex":"The audience listened carefully."},{"en":"slide","id":"slide","ex":"Please look at the next slide."},{"en":"point","id":"poin","ex":"My first point is about cost."},{"en":"outline","id":"garis besar","ex":"Here is the outline."},{"en":"topic","id":"topik","ex":"Today's topic is customer service."},{"en":"aim / objective","id":"tujuan","ex":"The aim is to reduce costs."},{"en":"stress / emphasise","id":"menekankan","ex":"I want to stress this point."},{"en":"summarise","id":"merangkum","ex":"Let me summarise."},{"en":"handout","id":"bahan tertulis yang dibagikan","ex":"I'll give you a handout."},{"en":"pointer","id":"penunjuk","ex":"She used a laser pointer."},{"en":"Q&A session","id":"sesi tanya jawab","ex":"We have a Q&A at the end."},{"en":"rehearse","id":"berlatih","ex":"I rehearsed three times."},{"en":"eye contact","id":"kontak mata","ex":"Keep eye contact."},{"en":"pace","id":"tempo","ex":"Speak at a steady pace."},{"en":"nervous","id":"gugup","ex":"I feel nervous before speaking."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Menutup dan tanya jawab","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Merangkum","[[To summarise, ...]] / [[Let me quickly go over the main points.]]"],["Menutup","[[Thank you for your attention.]] / [[That's all from me. Thank you.]]"],["Membuka tanya jawab","[[Are there any questions?]] / [[I'd be glad to answer any questions.]]"],["Menghargai pertanyaan","[[That's a good question.]] / [[Thank you for asking.]]"],["Mengulang pertanyaan","[[If I understand correctly, you're asking ...]]"],["Jika tidak tahu jawaban","[[I'm afraid I don't have that figure with me. I'll get back to you.]]"],["Pertanyaan di luar topik","[[That's outside the scope of today's talk, but I'd be happy to discuss it later.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Tips tampil percaya diri","text":"**Berlatihlah** dengan suara keras, atur **tempo** (jangan terburu-buru), jeda sejenak setelah poin penting, jaga **kontak mata**, dan satu slide untuk satu pesan. Tarik napas dalam sebelum mulai agar tidak gugup."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: Pembukaan dan transisi","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Good morning, everyone. Thank you for being here. My name is Dina, and I'm from the Sales team.","id":"Selamat pagi semuanya. Terima kasih sudah hadir. Nama saya Dina, dari tim Penjualan."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Today I'd like to talk about our sales results for the first half of the year. I've divided my talk into three parts: the results, the problems, and the plan.","id":"Hari ini saya ingin membahas hasil penjualan kami untuk semester pertama. Saya membagi presentasi menjadi tiga bagian: hasil, masalah, dan rencana."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Let's begin with the results. As you can see on this slide, sales rose steadily until April.","id":"Mari mulai dengan hasilnya. Seperti terlihat di slide ini, penjualan naik stabil hingga April."},{"who":"Dina","en":"That brings me to the end of this part. Now let me turn to the problems.","id":"Itu mengakhiri bagian ini. Sekarang saya beralih ke masalahnya."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 2: Penutup dan tanya jawab","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"To sum up, sales are growing, but delivery is slow. I recommend adding two drivers.","id":"Singkatnya, penjualan tumbuh, tetapi pengiriman lambat. Saya merekomendasikan menambah dua pengemudi."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Thank you for your attention. I'd be happy to take any questions.","id":"Terima kasih atas perhatian Anda. Saya senang menjawab pertanyaan apa pun."},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Thank you, Dina. How much would the two drivers cost?","id":"Terima kasih, Dina. Berapa biaya dua pengemudi itu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"That's a good question. I'm afraid I don't have the exact figure with me, but I'll send it to you by this afternoon.","id":"Itu pertanyaan bagus. Sayangnya saya tidak membawa angka pastinya, tetapi akan saya kirim sore ini."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Struktur: **opening → outline → body → summary → closing → Q&A**.","Signposting: [[Let's move on to ...]], [[Turning to ...]], [[As you can see ...]].","Menutup: [[To sum up, ...]], [[Thank you for your attention.]]","Tanya jawab: [[That's a good question.]]; jika tidak tahu: [[I'll get back to you.]]","Latih, atur tempo, jaga kontak mata, satu slide satu pesan."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["audience","hadirin"],["outline","garis besar"],["handout","bahan tertulis"],["rehearse","berlatih"],["pace","tempo"]],"exp":"Kosakata presentasi.","k":"49c49d5b"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian presentasi dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["opening","menyapa dan menyebut topik"],["body","membahas poin"],["summary","merangkum"],["Q&A","menjawab pertanyaan"]],"exp":"Bagian presentasi.","k":"efc57ce2"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan ungkapan dengan fungsinya:","pairs":[["Let's move on to ...","pindah poin"],["For example, ...","memberi contoh"],["To sum up, ...","merangkum"],["As you can see ...","merujuk ke slide"]],"exp":"Signposting.","k":"845d5a4d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara membuka presentasi yang baik adalah...","options":["Good morning, everyone. Today I'd like to talk about ...","Um, okay, so ...","Don't listen.","Let's finish."],"answer":0,"exp":"Jelas dan sopan.","k":"b07bee36"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk menyebut garis besar adalah...","options":["I've divided my talk into three parts.","Sit down.","I forgot.","No parts."],"answer":0,"exp":"Outline.","k":"1a93997b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk pindah ke poin berikutnya adalah...","options":["Let's move on to the next point.","Let's go home.","That's all.","Stop."],"answer":0,"exp":"Transisi.","k":"1d54fbb7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk merujuk ke slide adalah...","options":["As you can see on this slide, ...","Look away.","Close your eyes.","Slide is old."],"answer":0,"exp":"Merujuk.","k":"d2cdb13d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk menutup presentasi adalah...","options":["Thank you for your attention.","Good morning.","Let's start.","Wait."],"answer":0,"exp":"Penutup.","k":"fb863e8a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk membuka tanya jawab adalah...","options":["Are there any questions?","No questions.","Be quiet.","Go away."],"answer":0,"exp":"Q&A.","k":"01ab8c6e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jika tidak tahu jawaban, kita berkata...","options":["I'm afraid I don't have that figure. I'll get back to you.","I don't care.","Stupid question.","Ask someone else."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan dan jujur.","k":"d0725520"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jawaban yang tepat untuk menghargai pertanyaan adalah...","options":["That's a good question.","That's a silly question.","Why ask?","Next."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menghargai.","k":"0c95fd98"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tips yang benar untuk slide adalah...","options":["satu slide untuk satu pesan","satu slide penuh teks kecil","tanpa slide dan tanpa berbicara","sepuluh pesan per slide"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sederhana.","k":"c9c9b2ab"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tips mengurangi gugup adalah...","options":["berlatih dan menarik napas dalam","berbicara sangat cepat","tidak melihat siapa pun","tidak bersiap"],"answer":0,"exp":"Latihan.","k":"5533a64e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas perhatian Anda.","q":"Thank you for your ___.","answers":["attention"],"hint":"perhatian","exp":"attention.","k":"19b0949d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan membahas tiga poin.","q":"I'll ___ three points.","answers":["cover"],"hint":"membahas","exp":"cover.","k":"f29765a4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mari kita mulai dengan poin pertama.","q":"Let's ___ with the first point.","answers":["begin","start"],"hint":"mulai","exp":"begin.","k":"6ada77a6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Seperti terlihat pada slide ini ...","q":"As you can ___ on this slide, ...","answers":["see"],"hint":"melihat","exp":"As you can see.","k":"24e91410"},{"type":"fill","id":"Singkatnya, penjualan naik.","q":"To ___ up, sales rose.","answers":["sum"],"hint":"jumlah","exp":"To sum up.","k":"72067a52"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan menghubungi Anda kembali.","q":"I'll get ___ to you.","answers":["back"],"hint":"kembali","exp":"get back to you.","k":"755407db"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya senang menjawab pertanyaan apa pun.\"","answer":"I would be happy to take any questions.","exp":"take any questions.","k":"ca3cfbec"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sekarang saya beralih ke masalahnya.\"","answer":"Now let me turn to the problems.","exp":"turn to.","k":"b5ddfdad"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Today I would like to talk about our sales results","options":["Hari ini saya ingin membahas hasil penjualan kami","Hari ini kami libur","Saya menjual hari ini","Saya terlambat hari ini"],"answer":0,"exp":"talk about.","k":"9b82834d"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"That is a good question","options":["Itu pertanyaan bagus","Itu jawaban salah","Saya tidak tahu","Saya tidak mau"],"answer":0,"exp":"good question.","k":"01dff69c"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Thank you for your attention","options":["Terima kasih atas perhatian Anda","Terima kasih kembali","Selamat tidur","Sampai besok"],"answer":0,"exp":"attention.","k":"a6d6ecd1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Nama saya Dina.","q":"Let me ___ myself. I'm Dina.","answers":["introduce"],"hint":"memperkenalkan","exp":"introduce myself.","k":"772ff16f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tujuan presentasi ini adalah mengurangi biaya.","q":"The ___ of this presentation is to reduce costs.","answers":["aim","objective","purpose"],"hint":"tujuan","exp":"aim.","k":"91098823"},{"type":"fill","id":"Topik hari ini adalah layanan pelanggan.","q":"The ___ of my presentation is customer service.","answers":["topic"],"hint":"topik","exp":"topic.","k":"23a30bb3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Selain itu, biayanya turun.","q":"In ___, costs fell.","answers":["addition"],"hint":"tambahan","exp":"In addition.","k":"5dfe6378"},{"type":"fill","id":"Yang ingin saya tekankan adalah kualitas.","q":"What I want to ___ is quality.","answers":["stress","emphasise","emphasize"],"hint":"menekankan","exp":"stress.","k":"34e03d40"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mari kita lanjut ke bagian berikutnya.","q":"Let's move ___ to the next part.","answers":["on"],"hint":"lanjut","exp":"move on.","k":"f034c0cd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bagian ini selesai.","q":"That brings me to the ___ of this part.","answers":["end"],"hint":"akhir","exp":"end.","k":"f4ed318f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan membagikan bahan tertulis.","q":"I will give you a ___.","answers":["handout"],"hint":"bahan tertulis","exp":"handout.","k":"901856ec"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jaga kontak mata.","q":"Keep eye ___.","answers":["contact"],"hint":"kontak","exp":"eye contact.","k":"443f4e6c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bicara dengan tempo yang stabil.","q":"Speak at a steady ___.","answers":["pace"],"hint":"tempo","exp":"pace.","k":"86cf75df"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami punya sesi tanya jawab di akhir.","q":"We have a Q&A ___ at the end.","answers":["session"],"hint":"sesi","exp":"Q&A session.","k":"d0c7e264"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang membuka dengan baik?","options":["Good afternoon, everyone. Today I'll talk about our new product.","So um yeah.","Hello hello.","Ready?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Jelas.","k":"ea6026c2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyebut garis besar?","options":["I'll cover three points: cost, quality, and time.","I will talk.","Many points.","Points."],"answer":0,"exp":"Outline.","k":"dc0a4078"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang transisi 'selain itu'?","options":["What's more, the price is low.","Hello.","Goodbye.","Maybe."],"answer":0,"exp":"What's more.","k":"5e53eb56"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang merangkum?","options":["Let me quickly go over the main points.","Let me sleep.","Let me go.","Let me out."],"answer":0,"exp":"Go over.","k":"35df6370"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menjawab pertanyaan yang sulit dengan sopan?","options":["That's a difficult question. Let me think for a moment.","Too hard.","Don't ask.","No answer."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"639c619a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tidak profesional?","options":["Um, so, like, you know, whatever.","Let me explain.","As you can see.","To sum up."],"answer":0,"exp":"Terlalu banyak kata pengisi.","k":"905bffb5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"stress\" dalam presentasi berarti...","options":["menekankan","stres","menyembunyikan","menyalin"],"answer":0,"exp":"stress = emphasise.","k":"7015ab09"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"pace\" artinya...","options":["tempo","langkah kaki saja","kursi","nada"],"answer":0,"exp":"pace.","k":"d98e61c9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"nervous\" artinya...","options":["gugup","bahagia","lapar","kuat"],"answer":0,"exp":"nervous.","k":"3464b92f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jika ada gangguan, kita berkata...","options":["Sorry, let me continue.","Stop it.","I quit.","Bye."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"588e9005"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat untuk memulai bagian kedua?","options":["Now let's turn to the second part.","Now we sleep.","Now bye.","Now no."],"answer":0,"exp":"turn to.","k":"c14d1cc2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang tepat untuk mengundang pertanyaan?","options":["Please feel free to ask questions.","Don't ask.","No questions allowed.","Stop."],"answer":0,"exp":"Mengundang.","k":"9fefdba9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Presentasi yang baik biasanya...","options":["terstruktur dan jelas","acak","sangat panjang","tanpa tujuan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Terstruktur.","k":"418b24ab"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya telah membagi presentasi ini menjadi tiga bagian.\"","answer":"I have divided my talk into three parts.","exp":"divided into.","k":"34d14fdf"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["summarise","merangkum"],["emphasise","menekankan"],["audience","hadirin"],["slide","lembar tayang"]],"exp":"Kosakata.","k":"9cb8548e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Please feel free to interrupt","options":["Silakan menyela jika perlu","Jangan bicara","Saya akan pergi","Tolong diam"],"answer":0,"exp":"feel free.","k":"fe554ffe"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I will get back to you with the figure","options":["Saya akan menghubungi Anda kembali dengan angkanya","Saya lupa angkanya","Angkanya salah","Saya tidak punya angka"],"answer":0,"exp":"get back to you.","k":"ca057df9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Selamat pagi semuanya, terima kasih sudah hadir.","q":"Good morning, everyone. Thank you for ___.","answers":["coming","attending"],"hint":"datang","exp":"coming.","k":"f027fd1d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Hari ini saya akan membahas tiga hal.","q":"Today I will ___ three points.","answers":["cover","discuss"],"hint":"membahas","exp":"cover.","k":"17b725aa"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertama, mari kita lihat latar belakangnya.","q":"First, let's look ___ the background.","answers":["at"],"hint":"kata depan","exp":"look at.","k":"3cde0cef"},{"type":"fill","id":"Seperti yang Anda lihat pada slide ini...","q":"As you can ___ on this slide...","answers":["see"],"hint":"melihat","exp":"see.","k":"ea0d5e6e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Silakan bertanya di akhir presentasi.","q":"Please ask questions at the ___.","answers":["end"],"hint":"akhir","exp":"end.","k":"cd505840"},{"type":"fill","id":"Untuk meringkas, produk ini hemat biaya.","q":"To ___ up, this product is cost-effective.","answers":["sum"],"hint":"meringkas","exp":"sum up.","k":"5a5fafee"},{"type":"fill","id":"Itu membawa saya ke poin berikutnya.","q":"That ___ me to my next point.","answers":["brings","leads"],"hint":"membawa","exp":"brings.","k":"79896225"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya ingin menyoroti angka ini.","q":"I'd like to ___ this figure.","answers":["highlight"],"hint":"menyoroti","exp":"highlight.","k":"427db98f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Membuka presentasi:","options":["Today I'd like to talk about...","Um, so...","Don't look.","Whatever."],"answer":0,"exp":"Opening.","k":"c48289be"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Menutup presentasi:","options":["That's all from me. Thank you.","Done.","Bye.","Finish."],"answer":0,"exp":"Closing.","k":"a36d2d2d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Slide\" artinya...","options":["lembar tayang","lantai","pintu","meja"],"answer":0,"exp":"slide.","k":"29871b46"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Audience\" artinya...","options":["hadirin","pembicara","pemilik","tamu rumah"],"answer":0,"exp":"audience.","k":"75abf1fa"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Overview\" artinya...","options":["gambaran umum","detail kecil","akhir","kritik"],"answer":0,"exp":"overview.","k":"8d26759b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Beralih ke topik berikut:","options":["Moving on to...","Stop.","Wait for me.","Who cares."],"answer":0,"exp":"Moving on.","k":"6dd925d6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mengundang pertanyaan:","options":["Are there any questions?","No questions!","Don't ask.","Silence."],"answer":0,"exp":"Questions.","k":"a0a60a97"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tip presentasi yang baik:","options":["kontak mata dan suara jelas","membaca slide terus","bicara pelan sekali","membelakangi hadirin"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tips.","k":"10d226d6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat benar:","options":["I will start with an overview.","I will starting with overview.","I starts with overview.","I will started with overview."],"answer":0,"exp":"will start.","k":"19ea43b9"}